<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωσ-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spindle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				24.70
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1062
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>thread, yarn</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνου κ.</span>, of
			a <i>net</i> (periphr. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωστὸν
			λίνον</span> Sch.), <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				507
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1001
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>skein</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				1349
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				567
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.558d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>thread of fate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοιρῶν κλωστῆρι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					292.6
				</span></i>
			 (Heraclea ad Latmum), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				1.220
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωστείρων</span> is a mason's
			error for -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τήρων</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> μοιρίδιοι κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.1339
				</span></i>
			.</div>
